{"v":15,"id":"e02","kid":"emma","title":"A New Friend at the Bus Stop","zh":"公交站的新朋友","level":"A2","genre":"留学生活 · 故事","src":"original","sum":"刚到温哥华的陈浩很害羞。一个雨天，他鼓起勇气和拿着太空书的女孩玛雅聊起土星，交到了第一个朋友，还加入了天文社。","words":281,"paras":[{"t":"It was Chen Hao's second week in Vancouver, Canada. Every morning, he waited for the school bus at the corner of his street, and every morning he stood a little away from the other kids and looked at his shoes. His English was not bad, but he was shy, and the other students talked so fast.","w":[[0,2,"it",-1],[3,6,"was",-1],[7,11,"Chen",-1],[12,17,"hao's",-1],[18,24,"second",-1],[25,29,"week",-1],[30,32,"in",-1],[33,42,"vancouver",-1],[44,50,"canada",-1],[52,57,"every",-1],[58,65,"morning",-1],[67,69,"he",-1],[70,76,"waited",-1],[77,80,"for",-1],[81,84,"the",-1],[85,91,"school",0],[92,95,"bus",0],[96,98,"at",-1],[99,102,"the",-1],[103,109,"corner",-1],[110,112,"of",-1],[113,116,"his",-1],[117,123,"street",-1],[125,128,"and",-1],[129,134,"every",-1],[135,142,"morning",-1],[143,145,"he",-1],[146,151,"stood",-1],[152,153,"a",1],[154,160,"little",1],[161,165,"away",1],[166,170,"from",1],[171,174,"the",-1],[175,180,"other",-1],[181,185,"kids",-1],[186,189,"and",-1],[190,196,"looked",2],[197,199,"at",2],[200,203,"his",-1],[204,209,"shoes",-1],[211,214,"his",-1],[215,222,"english",-1],[223,226,"was",-1],[227,230,"not",-1],[231,234,"bad",-1],[236,239,"but",-1],[240,242,"he",-1],[243,246,"was",-1],[247,250,"shy",-1],[252,255,"and",-1],[256,259,"the",-1],[260,265,"other",-1],[266,274,"students",-1],[275,281,"talked",-1],[282,284,"so",-1],[285,289,"fast",-1]]},{"t":"One rainy Tuesday, a girl with a bright yellow umbrella stood next to him. She was holding a book about space. Chen Hao noticed the picture of Saturn on the cover. He loved space. Back in China, he had a telescope on his balcony.","w":[[0,3,"one",-1],[4,9,"rainy",-1],[10,17,"tuesday",-1],[19,20,"a",-1],[21,25,"girl",-1],[26,30,"with",-1],[31,32,"a",-1],[33,39,"bright",-1],[40,46,"yellow",-1],[47,55,"umbrella",-1],[56,61,"stood",-1],[62,66,"next",3],[67,69,"to",3],[70,73,"him",-1],[75,78,"she",-1],[79,82,"was",-1],[83,90,"holding",-1],[91,92,"a",-1],[93,97,"book",-1],[98,103,"about",-1],[104,109,"space",-1],[111,115,"Chen",-1],[116,119,"Hao",-1],[120,127,"noticed",-1],[128,131,"the",-1],[132,139,"picture",-1],[140,142,"of",-1],[143,149,"saturn",-1],[150,152,"on",-1],[153,156,"the",-1],[157,162,"cover",-1],[164,166,"he",-1],[167,172,"loved",-1],[173,178,"space",-1],[180,184,"back",4],[185,187,"in",4],[188,193,"china",4],[195,197,"he",-1],[198,201,"had",-1],[202,203,"a",-1],[204,213,"telescope",-1],[214,216,"on",-1],[217,220,"his",-1],[221,228,"balcony",-1]]},{"t":"He wanted to say something, but his heart was beating fast. Finally, he pointed at the book. \"Saturn has more than one hundred moons,\" he said quietly.","w":[[0,2,"he",-1],[3,9,"wanted",-1],[10,12,"to",-1],[13,16,"say",-1],[17,26,"something",-1],[28,31,"but",-1],[32,35,"his",-1],[36,41,"heart",-1],[42,45,"was",-1],[46,53,"beating",-1],[54,58,"fast",-1],[60,67,"finally",-1],[69,71,"he",-1],[72,79,"pointed",5],[80,82,"at",5],[83,86,"the",-1],[87,91,"book",-1],[94,100,"saturn",-1],[101,104,"has",-1],[105,109,"more",6],[110,114,"than",6],[115,118,"one",-1],[119,126,"hundred",-1],[127,132,"moons",-1],[135,137,"he",-1],[138,142,"said",-1],[143,150,"quietly",-1]]},{"t":"The girl looked up and smiled. \"Really? I thought it had about sixty!\"","w":[[0,3,"the",-1],[4,8,"girl",-1],[9,15,"looked",7],[16,18,"up",7],[19,22,"and",-1],[23,29,"smiled",-1],[32,38,"really",-1],[40,41,"i",-1],[42,49,"thought",-1],[50,52,"it",-1],[53,56,"had",-1],[57,62,"about",-1],[63,68,"sixty",-1]]},{"t":"\"Scientists found a lot of new ones,\" Chen Hao said. \"I read about it last month.\"","w":[[1,11,"scientists",-1],[12,17,"found",-1],[18,19,"a",8],[20,23,"lot",8],[24,26,"of",8],[27,30,"new",-1],[31,35,"ones",-1],[38,42,"Chen",-1],[43,46,"Hao",-1],[47,51,"said",-1],[54,55,"i",-1],[56,60,"read",-1],[61,66,"about",-1],[67,69,"it",-1],[70,74,"last",-1],[75,80,"month",-1]]},{"t":"\"Cool! I'm Maya, by the way. Do you like astronomy?\"","w":[[1,5,"Cool",-1],[7,10,"i'm",-1],[11,15,"Maya",-1],[17,19,"by",9],[20,23,"the",9],[24,27,"way",9],[29,31,"do",-1],[32,35,"you",-1],[36,40,"like",-1],[41,50,"astronomy",-1]]},{"t":"\"Yes, very much. I'm Hao.\"","w":[[1,4,"yes",-1],[6,10,"very",-1],[11,15,"much",-1],[17,20,"i'm",-1],[21,24,"Hao",-1]]},{"t":"They talked about planets until the bus arrived, and they sat together on the bus. Maya told him about the astronomy club at their school. It met every Thursday after lunch in the science room. \"You should come,\" she said. \"We need people who know facts like that!\"","w":[[0,4,"they",-1],[5,11,"talked",10],[12,17,"about",10],[18,25,"planets",-1],[26,31,"until",-1],[32,35,"the",-1],[36,39,"bus",-1],[40,47,"arrived",-1],[49,52,"and",-1],[53,57,"they",-1],[58,61,"sat",-1],[62,70,"together",-1],[71,73,"on",-1],[74,77,"the",-1],[78,81,"bus",-1],[83,87,"Maya",-1],[88,92,"told",11],[93,96,"him",11],[97,102,"about",11],[103,106,"the",-1],[107,116,"astronomy",-1],[117,121,"club",-1],[122,124,"at",-1],[125,130,"their",-1],[131,137,"school",-1],[139,141,"it",-1],[142,145,"met",-1],[146,151,"every",-1],[152,160,"thursday",-1],[161,166,"after",-1],[167,172,"lunch",-1],[173,175,"in",-1],[176,179,"the",-1],[180,187,"science",-1],[188,192,"room",-1],[195,198,"you",-1],[199,205,"should",-1],[206,210,"come",-1],[213,216,"she",-1],[217,221,"said",-1],[224,226,"we",-1],[227,231,"need",-1],[232,238,"people",-1],[239,242,"who",-1],[243,247,"know",-1],[248,253,"facts",-1],[254,258,"like",-1],[259,263,"that",-1]]},{"t":"On Thursday, Chen Hao went to the club. There were eight students, and Maya introduced him to everyone. He still felt a little nervous, but this time he did not look at his shoes.","w":[[0,2,"on",-1],[3,11,"thursday",-1],[13,17,"Chen",-1],[18,21,"Hao",-1],[22,26,"went",-1],[27,29,"to",-1],[30,33,"the",-1],[34,38,"club",-1],[40,45,"there",-1],[46,50,"were",-1